# GraphLatency

## Import

```svelte
import { GraphLatency } from 'markgraphy';
```

## Basic usage

```svelte
<GraphLatency
  title="example"
  unit={'ms'}
/>
```

## Props

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `title` | `string` | `—` | — |
| `data` | `LatencyPoint[]` | `—` | — |
| `unit?` | `string` | `'ms'` | — |
| `height?` | `number` | `8` | — |
| `labels?` | `[string, string]` | `—` | — |
| `max?` | `number` | `—` | — |
| `palette?` | `GraphPalette` | `—` | — |
| `corner?` | `string` | `—` | — |
| `class?` | `string` | `''` | — |

## Exported types

- `LatencyPoint`
- `GraphLatencyProps`
